flowchart TD
  ENTRY[Open CareTrip Ops Web Console] --> DASH[Dashboard - case list and case status]
  DASH --> SELECT{Select existing case or create new?}
  SELECT -->|New case| FORM[Case Intake - text request and explicit demo date]
  FORM --> CREATE[Submit POST /api/cases]
  CREATE --> CASE[Case Workspace - same persisted Case ID]
  SELECT -->|Existing case| CASE

  subgraph WORKSPACE[Case Workspace - tabs and panels]
    CASE --> OVERVIEW[Overview - requirements and case state]
    CASE --> AGENTS[Agent Activity - persisted timeline and checkpoints]
    CASE --> OFFERS[Offer Comparison - synthetic candidate snapshots]
    CASE --> EVIDENCE[Evidence - source records and assessments]
    CASE --> APPROVAL[Approval Status - pending or decided]
    CASE --> ORDERS[Mock Order - read-back status]
    CASE --> AUDIT[Audit Events - persisted decisions and errors]
  end

  OVERVIEW --> NEEDS{Clarification requested?}
  NEEDS -->|Yes| CLARIFY[Answer missing fields via REST clarification]
  CLARIFY --> REFRESH[Refresh persisted state]
  NEEDS -->|No| REFRESH
  AGENTS --> REFRESH
  OFFERS --> EVIDENCE
  EVIDENCE --> VERIFIED{Verified offer available?}
  VERIFIED -->|No| EXCEPTION[Human review or blocked state - no invented offer]
  VERIFIED -->|Yes| PENDING[Show verified offer and pending approval]
  PENDING --> PHONE[Open linked phone-sized view - same Case ID]
  PHONE --> REFRESH
  APPROVAL --> REFRESH
  ORDERS --> REFRESH
  AUDIT --> REFRESH
  EXCEPTION --> REFRESH
  REFRESH --> CASE

  NOTE[Web MVP: one React SPA; typed REST client; poll persisted state every 1-2 seconds]
  NOTE -.-> CASE
  LIMIT[No real bookings, live supplier inventory, RBAC, or unsupported admin controls]
  LIMIT -.-> DASH

  classDef page fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#3779cb,color:#17375b
  classDef action fill:#eaf8f0,stroke:#28875c,color:#154a32
  classDef caution fill:#fff2e6,stroke:#d58935,color:#70430b
  class ENTRY,DASH,FORM,CASE,OVERVIEW,AGENTS,OFFERS,EVIDENCE,APPROVAL,ORDERS,AUDIT,PHONE page
  class CREATE,CLARIFY,REFRESH action
  class EXCEPTION,NOTE,LIMIT caution
